@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 消费者登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "consumer",
  "login_name": "13812345678",
  "password": "Demo1234",
  "remember": true
}

